WEBVTT

00:00:09.364 --> 00:00:11.283
-MAVIS: Johnny!
-(Johnny grunts)

00:00:11.366 --> 00:00:12.910
(strains):
Mavis!

00:00:15.621 --> 00:00:17.623
(birds chirping)

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.962
(blimp motor rumbling, hissing)

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.509
(chuckles):
Hey.

00:00:28.592 --> 00:00:30.135
Not bad, huh?

00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:32.137
(shrieks)

00:00:32.221 --> 00:00:34.598
(grunting)

00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:37.601
(groans)

00:00:37.684 --> 00:00:38.685
Much better.

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:39.895
-(smooches)
-(camera clicks)

00:00:41.396 --> 00:00:42.981
(sighs)

00:00:43.065 --> 00:00:44.066
(wolf pups snoring)

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:45.150
(sighs)

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:46.985
I miss being Walter. Ow!

00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:48.445
Whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa-whoa! No-no!

00:00:48.529 --> 00:00:50.113
You-you are keeping those on!

00:00:50.197 --> 00:00:52.324
GRIFFIN:
Don't be so uptight. I'm inviz.

00:00:52.407 --> 00:00:54.409
Man, just because you're invisible

00:00:54.493 --> 00:00:56.370
doesn't mean you get to be naked.

00:00:56.453 --> 00:00:57.788
What is wrong with you?

00:00:57.871 --> 00:00:59.790
All right, Blobby, you're up.

00:01:04.461 --> 00:01:07.172
Uh... looking good?

00:01:09.258 --> 00:01:10.884
(growls)

00:01:16.098 --> 00:01:18.559
(chuckling):
Oh.

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.562
♪ ♪

00:01:23.939 --> 00:01:26.316
Go ahead. Now's your chance.

00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:30.362
Hey, it was fun being a monster
for a little bit.

00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:32.489
I wonder if Van Helsing
can adjust this thing

00:01:32.573 --> 00:01:34.950
so that I'm a monster but still me.

00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:37.744
-I don't think so.
-Ah, come on.

00:01:37.828 --> 00:01:40.414
-How 'bout just a tail?
-(chuckles): No, Johnny.

00:01:40.497 --> 00:01:42.958
You're perfect just the way you are.

00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:45.335
Uh, Mavey? Johnny?

00:01:45.419 --> 00:01:47.421
-Yes?
-Well, I-I...

00:01:47.504 --> 00:01:48.881
I know a lot has happened,

00:01:48.964 --> 00:01:52.885
but I was hoping that, uh,

00:01:52.968 --> 00:01:56.889
if-if you're still interested,
I, uh... (chuckles)

00:01:56.972 --> 00:02:00.601
I wanted to say that the hotel... (sighs)

00:02:00.684 --> 00:02:02.769
that the hotel is

00:02:02.853 --> 00:02:05.188
-destroyed!
-JOHNNY and MAVIS: Huh?!

00:02:05.272 --> 00:02:07.649
♪ ♪

00:02:07.733 --> 00:02:09.568
What happened?!

00:02:10.652 --> 00:02:12.654
(heavy footsteps booming)

00:02:15.699 --> 00:02:18.160
(roaring)

00:02:21.121 --> 00:02:23.749
My... my...

00:02:23.832 --> 00:02:25.709
my hotel!

00:02:25.792 --> 00:02:28.003
My hotel, my hotel, my hotel!

00:02:28.086 --> 00:02:31.173
My hotel!

00:02:33.258 --> 00:02:34.468
(squeaking)

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.684
My... my hotel.

00:02:42.768 --> 00:02:44.269
My hotel.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.189
My hotel.

00:02:47.272 --> 00:02:49.399
-My hotel.
-(muffled dings)

00:02:49.483 --> 00:02:51.276
My hotel.

00:02:52.361 --> 00:02:54.738
(others gasping, murmuring)

00:02:54.821 --> 00:02:57.324
-Oh, no.
-Oh, man, this is unbelievable.

00:03:01.244 --> 00:03:03.121
Hi, Mama! Hi, Papa!

00:03:03.205 --> 00:03:05.248
MAVIS and JOHNNY:
Dennis!

00:03:05.332 --> 00:03:07.334
♪ ♪

00:03:13.715 --> 00:03:15.467
JOHNNY:
Don't worry, Drac.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.761
We'll rebuild it just the way it was.

00:03:19.012 --> 00:03:20.180
No.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:25.185
Rebuild it the way you want to.

00:03:27.688 --> 00:03:29.731
It's your hotel now.

00:03:31.608 --> 00:03:33.485
Dad, are you sure?

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:39.074
It's time to begin a new chapter.

00:03:42.452 --> 00:03:45.789
(fireworks popping, whistling)

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:52.170
Okay, Drac, open your eyes!

00:03:52.254 --> 00:03:53.463
(gasps)

00:03:53.547 --> 00:03:55.549
♪ ♪

00:03:57.134 --> 00:04:00.095
DRACULA:
The... the hotel!

00:04:00.178 --> 00:04:02.055
I-I don't understand.

00:04:02.139 --> 00:04:04.349
It-It's exactly the same.

00:04:04.433 --> 00:04:08.812
Well, we just made
a couple of tiny adjustments.

00:04:08.895 --> 00:04:10.313
Huh?

00:04:10.397 --> 00:04:11.648
(excited chatter)

00:04:11.732 --> 00:04:14.317
("Love Is Not Hard to Find" by Yendry
playing)

00:04:18.822 --> 00:04:20.282
(horn honks)

00:04:23.744 --> 00:04:25.829
♪ That's what you needed ♪

00:04:25.912 --> 00:04:27.622
♪ People you love to be there ♪

00:04:27.706 --> 00:04:29.833
♪ To support and believe in ♪

00:04:29.916 --> 00:04:32.669
♪ See, the best part is when you realize
you're not scared to find ♪

00:04:32.753 --> 00:04:35.714
-(giggling)
-♪ To find, find the good, good inside ♪

00:04:35.797 --> 00:04:37.799
♪ Don't let your fears
cloud your feelings ♪

00:04:37.883 --> 00:04:39.384
(laughs, grunts)

00:04:39.468 --> 00:04:41.303
♪ We all got bad sides ♪

00:04:41.386 --> 00:04:43.180
♪ But all that matters
in front of your eyes ♪

00:04:43.263 --> 00:04:44.848
-(grunting)
-♪ Love is not hard to find ♪

00:04:44.931 --> 00:04:46.433
♪ If we believe in us ♪

00:04:46.516 --> 00:04:50.979
-(whoops, gasps)
-♪ As hard as it can be ♪

00:04:51.063 --> 00:04:54.357
♪ Remember by your side,
you got a family ♪

00:04:54.441 --> 00:04:57.360
♪ No matter what,
we gonna love you for who you are ♪

00:04:57.444 --> 00:04:58.695
♪ There's no limit ♪

00:04:58.779 --> 00:05:01.406
♪ Open your eyes,
love is not hard to find ♪

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.033
(whooping, laughing)

00:05:03.116 --> 00:05:06.203
♪ All around the world,
but home is where we are ♪

00:05:06.286 --> 00:05:09.456
(singing in Spanish)

00:05:09.539 --> 00:05:11.708
♪ We always believed in magic ♪

00:05:11.792 --> 00:05:13.585
(singing in Spanish)

00:05:13.668 --> 00:05:15.378
-(laughing)
-♪ If we just smile, we'll be fine ♪

00:05:15.462 --> 00:05:17.214
♪ It's always the hardest to say goodbye ♪

00:05:17.297 --> 00:05:19.049
♪ We all got bad sides ♪

00:05:19.132 --> 00:05:21.093
