00:05:21.176 --> 00:05:22.761
-(laughing)
-♪ Love is not hard to find ♪

00:05:22.844 --> 00:05:25.305
-♪ If we believe in us ♪
-Whoa! (grunts) Ow!

00:05:25.388 --> 00:05:28.892
